{"type":"process","design":"P66_STEP_FLOW","title":"Automated governance and quality with Dataplex","lead":"Dataplex automates metadata discovery, access control, and continuous quality rules without moving data.","items":[{"title":"Metadata discovery and cataloging","text":"Scans new tables and storage buckets automatically to register technical schemas, business glossary terms, and lineage without duplicating files.","icon":"cloud-analytics"},{"title":"Security and IAM propagation","text":"Applies centralized Identity and Access Management roles and column-level policy tags across regional and store datasets from one console.","icon":"shield-database"},{"title":"Completeness and freshness validation","text":"Executes out-of-the-box data quality checks against incoming transaction and stock records to verify non-null keys and timely arrival. It blocks bad schemas before pipelines ingest corrupted rows.","icon":"gear-chart"},{"title":"Cloud Monitoring rule alerts","text":"Routes failed validation logs directly to Cloud Monitoring dashboards so data stewards receive immediate notifications before reports refresh.","icon":"cloud-signal"}],"points":["Zero data movement across underlying storage layers","Centralized audit trail for regulatory and internal compliance","Automated quarantine of malformed store or web records"],"notes":"Dataplex governs Tailwind Traders datasets in place without requiring data movement across underlying storage. It automates metadata discovery, propagates IAM and column-level security policies, and triggers Cloud Monitoring alerts whenever completeness or freshness rules fail.

